<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent>.
<https://linkedevents.org/ontology/Event> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
